        <mxCell id="snack" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#7d3530;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;CLOSED-LOOP S-NACK RETRANSMISSION PROTOCOL&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#6b3330;font-size:10.5px;margin-top:3px;&quot;&gt;Smart Recovery: Requests only missing high-&amp;gamma;&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt; bands (&amp;Delta;k &amp;asymp; 1.2 MB, &amp;Delta;t &amp;asymp; 15 ms) &amp;mdash; Avoids 200 MB full retransmission&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f1f0;strokeColor=#d9b3ae;strokeWidth=1.3;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="232" y="366" width="651" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
